k [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]toggles its task between Next and In Progress, offering an optional[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Work Log entry when it goes back to Next. Nothing new is ever [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]written into the daily note.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]in_progress_task_link_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/in_progress_task_link_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-56[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-56/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-ledger-tools In Progress marks[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]progress-marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]progress-marks: add a display-only half-ring mark before In Progress [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Task Links under today's open Pomodoros (Live Preview widget, Reading [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]view post-processor, CSS, toggle command, refresh wiring) plus the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`api.progressMarks` v1 hint namespace, with conformance tests P1-P14.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-navigation-hotkeys Task Link lane toggle and [/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]api.taskLinkLane[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]link-lane-toggle[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]link-lane-toggle: build the two-state Next <-> In Progress toggle for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro Task Links on the Alt+N link pipeline (matcher, start-wins [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch planner, a styled optional Work Log prompt, preimage-checked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit, notices, progressMarks hint) and expose it as nav [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`api.taskLinkLane` v1, with tests L1-L15.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]task-status-cycler delegates Alt+[ / Alt+] on Task Links[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler-keys[dim] · [dim][/dim]after link-lane-toggle[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler-keys: route single and counted Alt+[ / Alt+] presses on Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Task Links to nav `api.taskLinkLane`, skip those lines in counted ranges[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that start elsewhere, and keep every other line's behavior unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, end-to-end verification, and memory follow-up[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after progress-marks, cycler-keys[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-verify: document the mark and toggle contract in bob-cli [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`docs/plan.md` (vectors, live checklist, Surfaces/Notices rows), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-check the plugin README rows, run the full plugin suite and sync, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and record a PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP for memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-56","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-56.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-58c38bb55ad882ead7deaa241c25ccbc","started_at":"2026-10-07T14:19:22.282423+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"caf9237bbf683938b48099e6b36f5ccfecedad8